Project: Cars24 Price Prediction

This project aims to predict the selling price of used cars listed on Cars24 using Machine Learning models.

🔹 Features:

Data preprocessing (cleaning, handling missing values, encoding categorical features).

Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) with visualizations.

Feature engineering for better model performance.

Model training with algorithms such as Linear Regression, Random Forest, and XGBoost.

Model evaluation using metrics like R² score, MAE, and RMSE.

🔹 Tools & Libraries:

Python

Pandas, NumPy

Matplotlib, Seaborn

Scikit-learn

Jupyter Notebook

🔹 Goal:

To build a reliable model that helps estimate the resale value of cars, assisting both buyers and sellers in making informed decisions.
